silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_02_twelve_leg_deep_dive_sections_08_process_leg_concrete_anchor silm:hasExample "In 'ProcessLegConcreteAnchor', the bare-symbol→anchor table grounds the abstract symbols in the Tartu-Animal-Clinic / Mittens-2026-05-18 domain story. For example, SleepProcess_7h: the daily sleep process of Mittens, duration approximately 7 hours; observed and reported by the owner at the 2026 Tartu Animal Clinic exam; typed as BFO:0000015 (process); distinct from the individual Mittens; also, ProcessArrow_Sleep: the typed arrow SleepProcess_7h -> MittensColimitApex; distinct from all other legs; also, OwnerReport_Tartu_2026: the 2026-05-18 owner interview at Tartu Animal Clinic reporting Mittens' sleep behavior; the source provenance for SleepProcess_7h; a verbal report, not a measurement event." .
